# Grade Reporter & Bug Hunt

This assignment practices Python loops, conditions, running totals, counting, and debugging.

## Files

### grade_reporter.py

This program loops through a list of five scores, assigns each learner a grade using if, elif, and else, counts the number of passes and failures, and calculates the average score.

### bug_hunt.py

This program fixes three bugs in a while loop program so that it correctly calculates the sum of the numbers 1 to 5.

## Part B: Bug Hunt Reflection

The hardest bug to find was the loop condition because it did not produce an error message. The program could run successfully but stop before adding 5, producing the wrong answer of 10 instead of 15. I knew something was wrong because the assignment stated that the correct answer should be 15, so I checked whether the loop was including the number 5.